# Multi-agent workflow (TutorOS)

Sequence (mandatory):

```
PM /speckit.specify + /speckit.clarify
 → Architect /speckit.plan + /speckit.checklist + /speckit.analyze
 → /speckit.tasks
 → human OK
 → Builder /speckit.implement
 → Tester (report + /speckit.converge)
 → PM Accept
```

Do not skip. Do not implement before Specified.

Status: Draft → Specified → In Progress → Testing → Accepted.

Artifacts: `specs/<nnn-name>/spec.md`, `plan.md`, `tasks.md`, `checklists/`, `analyze.md`.
Active feature: `.specify/feature.json` (not the git branch).

When Accepted, the same PR updates `README.md`, `catalog/`, and `tutor-platform-architecture.html` if screens, APIs, tables, or ports changed.

No `/speckit.implement` on `001-platform-architecture` until architecture HTML + plan are accepted.
